{
  "loginMain": "<main id=\"giris\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n\n    <aside class=\"side\" aria-label=\"Veli hesabı avantajları\">\n      <span class=\"ring\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ring r2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <p class=\"eb\">Veli hesabı</p>\n      <h2 class=\"s\">Tüm ders süreciniz, tek ekranda.</h2>\n      <p>Ders kayıtlarını, öğretmen raporlarını, kalan ders hakkınızı ve ödemelerinizi istediğiniz an hesabınızdan takip edin.</p>\n      <ul class=\"feat\">\n        <li><span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4\"/></svg></span><div><b>Ders kayıtları</b><span>Yapılan her dersin tarihi, süresi ve konusu</span></div></li>\n        <li><span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></span><div><b>Ders raporları</b><span>Her dersten sonra öğretmen notu, ödev ve gelişim özeti</span></div></li>\n        <li><span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19h16M6 15V9M11 15V5M16 15v-4\"/></svg></span><div><b>Kalan ders hakkı</b><span>Paketinizde kaç ders kaldığı, anlık olarak</span></div></li>\n        <li><span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2.5\" y=\"5\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M2.5 10h19M6 15h4\"/></svg></span><div><b>Paket ve ödemeler</b><span>Yeni paket satın alma ve ödeme geçmişi</span></div></li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"help\">Giriş yapamıyor musunuz? <a href=\"https://wa.me/905442939040?text=Merhaba%2C%20hesab%C4%B1ma%20giri%C5%9F%20yapam%C4%B1yorum.\">WhatsApp'tan yazın</a></p>\n    </aside>\n\n    <section class=\"fs\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Hesap\" id=\"tabs\">\n        <a role=\"tab\" id=\"t-login\" href=\"/tr/giris/\" aria-controls=\"p-login\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-view=\"login\">Giriş Yap</a>\n        <a role=\"tab\" id=\"t-reg\" href=\"/tr/giris/?mode=register\" aria-controls=\"p-reg\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-view=\"reg\">Kayıt Ol</a>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"panel\" id=\"p-login\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"t-login\" data-panel=\"login\">\n        <p class=\"demo\" id=\"demo-note\" hidden>Önizleme modu: Supabase bağlantısı girilmedi. Deneme için şifreye “yanlis” yazarak hata ve deneme sınırını, e-postaya “admin” yazarak iki adımlı doğrulamayı (kod 123456) görebilirsiniz.</p>\n        <h1 class=\"s\">Hesabınıza giriş yapın</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Oriens Academy hesabınıza güvenle erişin.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert\" data-alert role=\"alert\"></div>\n        <form id=\"f-login\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"l-email\">E-posta</label>\n            <div class=\"inp\">\n              <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 7l9 6 9-6\"/></svg>\n              <input id=\"l-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" inputmode=\"email\" autocomplete=\"username\" placeholder=\"ornek@eposta.com\" required aria-describedby=\"l-email-msg\">\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"msg\" id=\"l-email-msg\"></p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"field\" id=\"pw-field\">\n            <label for=\"l-pass\">Şifre <a class=\"link\" href=\"#sifre-sifirla\" data-view=\"forgot\">Şifremi unuttum</a></label>\n            <div class=\"inp\">\n              <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/></svg>\n              <input id=\"l-pass\" name=\"password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" placeholder=\"Şifreniz\" required aria-describedby=\"l-pass-msg l-caps\">\n              <button class=\"eye\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Şifreyi göster\" aria-controls=\"l-pass\" data-eye></button>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"caps\" id=\"l-caps\">Büyük harf kilidi açık.</p>\n            <p class=\"msg\" id=\"l-pass-msg\"></p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"row\" id=\"remember-row\">\n            <label class=\"chk\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"remember\" id=\"l-remember\" checked> Beni hatırla</label>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn-p submit\" type=\"submit\" id=\"l-submit\"><span>Giriş Yap</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>\n        </form>\n        <p class=\"alt\">Hesabınız yok mu? <a href=\"/tr/giris/?mode=register\" data-view=\"reg\">Kayıt olun</a></p>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"forgot\" hidden>\n        <h1 class=\"s\">Şifrenizi sıfırlayın</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Hesabınızın e-posta adresini yazın; şifrenizi yenilemeniz için bir bağlantı gönderelim.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert\" data-alert role=\"alert\"></div>\n        <form id=\"f-forgot\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"fg-email\">E-posta</label>\n            <div class=\"inp\">\n              <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 7l9 6 9-6\"/></svg>\n              <input id=\"fg-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" inputmode=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"ornek@eposta.com\" required aria-describedby=\"fg-email-msg\">\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"msg\" id=\"fg-email-msg\"></p>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn-p submit\" type=\"submit\"><span>Sıfırlama bağlantısı gönder</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>\n        </form>\n        <p class=\"alt\"><a href=\"/tr/giris/\" data-view=\"login\">← Girişe dön</a></p>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"forgot-sent\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"state-ic\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 7l9 6 9-6\"/></svg></div>\n        <h1 class=\"s\">Bağlantı gönderildi</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Bu adres kayıtlıysa <b data-echo-email></b> adresine şifre sıfırlama bağlantısı gönderdik. Bağlantı 1 saat geçerli.</p>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-g\" data-resend=\"forgot\" disabled><span>Tekrar gönder</span> <span data-cd></span></button>\n        <p class=\"alt\"><a href=\"/tr/giris/\" data-view=\"login\">← Girişe dön</a></p>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"new-password\" hidden>\n        <h1 class=\"s\">Yeni şifrenizi belirleyin</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Hesabınız için yeni bir şifre belirleyin.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert\" data-alert role=\"alert\"></div>\n        <form id=\"f-newpw\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"np-pass\">Yeni şifre</label>\n            <div class=\"inp\">\n              <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/></svg>\n              <input id=\"np-pass\" name=\"password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" placeholder=\"Şifreniz\" required minlength=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"np-pass-msg\">\n              <button class=\"eye\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Şifreyi göster\" aria-controls=\"np-pass\" data-eye></button>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"msg\" id=\"np-pass-msg\"></p>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn-p submit\" type=\"submit\"><span>Şifreyi kaydet</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"mfa\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"state-ic\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l8 3v6c0 4.5-3.4 8.3-8 9-4.6-.7-8-4.5-8-9V6z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></div>\n        <h1 class=\"s\">İki adımlı doğrulama</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Yönetici hesabınız için doğrulama uygulamanızdaki (Google Authenticator, 1Password vb.) 6 haneli kodu girin.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert\" data-alert role=\"alert\"></div>\n        <form id=\"f-mfa\" novalidate>\n          <fieldset class=\"otp\" aria-describedby=\"otp-msg\">\n            <legend class=\"sr\">6 haneli doğrulama kodu</legend>\n            <input inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" maxlength=\"1\" aria-label=\"1. hane\" pattern=\"[0-9]\">\n            <input inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"1\" aria-label=\"2. hane\" pattern=\"[0-9]\">\n            <input inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"1\" aria-label=\"3. hane\" pattern=\"[0-9]\">\n            <span class=\"otp-sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <input inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"1\" aria-label=\"4. hane\" pattern=\"[0-9]\">\n            <input inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"1\" aria-label=\"5. hane\" pattern=\"[0-9]\">\n            <input inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"1\" aria-label=\"6. hane\" pattern=\"[0-9]\">\n          </fieldset>\n          <p class=\"msg\" id=\"otp-msg\"></p>\n          <button class=\"btn-p submit\" type=\"submit\"><span>Doğrula ve devam et</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>\n        </form>\n        <p class=\"alt\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"mfa-cancel\">Farklı hesapla giriş yap</button></p>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"panel\" id=\"p-reg\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"t-reg\" data-panel=\"reg\" hidden>\n        <h1 class=\"s\">Veli hesabı oluşturun</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Paket satın almak ve dersleri takip etmek için hesabınızı oluşturun. Öğrenci bilgilerini sizin için biz ekliyoruz.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert\" data-alert role=\"alert\"></div>\n        <form id=\"f-reg\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"r-name\">Ad Soyad <small>Veli</small></label>\n            <div class=\"inp\">\n              <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 21c1.5-4 4.5-6 8-6s6.5 2 8 6\"/></svg>\n              <input id=\"r-name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"Adınız Soyadınız\" required aria-describedby=\"r-name-msg\">\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"msg\" id=\"r-name-msg\"></p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"r-email\">E-posta</label>\n            <div class=\"inp\">\n              <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 7l9 6 9-6\"/></svg>\n              <input id=\"r-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" inputmode=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"ornek@eposta.com\" required aria-describedby=\"r-email-msg\">\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"msg\" id=\"r-email-msg\"></p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"r-pass\">Şifre</label>\n            <div class=\"inp\">\n              <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/></svg>\n              <input id=\"r-pass\" name=\"password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" placeholder=\"Şifreniz\" required minlength=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"r-pass-msg\">\n              <button class=\"eye\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Şifreyi göster\" aria-controls=\"r-pass\" data-eye></button>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"msg\" id=\"r-pass-msg\"></p>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"chk\" style=\"margin:6px 0 4px\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"r-kvkk\" required aria-describedby=\"r-kvkk-msg\"> <span><a href=\"/tr/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gizlilik Politikası</a> ve <a href=\"/tr/terms/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kullanım Koşulları</a>'nı kabul ediyorum.</span></label>\n          <p class=\"msg\" id=\"r-kvkk-msg\" style=\"margin:0 0 22px 28px\"></p>\n          <button class=\"btn-p submit\" type=\"submit\"><span>Hesap Oluştur</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>\n        </form>\n        <p class=\"alt\">Zaten hesabınız var mı? <a href=\"/tr/giris/\" data-view=\"login\">Giriş yapın</a></p>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"panel\" data-panel=\"verify\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"state-ic\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 7l9 6 9-6\"/></svg></div>\n        <h1 class=\"s\">E-postanızı doğrulayın</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\"><b data-echo-email></b> adresine bir doğrulama bağlantısı gönderdik. Bağlantıya tıkladığınızda hesabınız açılır ve Hesabım sayfanıza yönlendirilirsiniz.</p>\n        <p class=\"hint\">E-posta gelmediyse gereksiz (spam) klasörüne bakın.</p>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-g\" data-resend=\"signup\" disabled><span>Tekrar gönder</span> <span data-cd></span></button>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"note\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/></svg>256-bit SSL ile korunan bağlantı</p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</main>",
